  "nine=false -> discrete sprite.",
  "",
  "TOUCH-FIRST STATES: active=selected/on (LIGHTER sprite) . active selector,",
  "pressed=:active+.pressed, checked=:checked+.checked, disabled=:disabled+.disabled.",
  "hover is desktop-only (@media (hover: hover)); hoverUses reuses a state sprite.",
  "sheets: {main: themed atlas} | {icons,grids: themed=false, rect tuyet doi, xuat 1 lan}",
  "sheet = ten sheet cua slice (mac dinh \"main\")",
  "sets: truc BO (set1/set2/set3) theo y-offset. rect ghi o toa do BO 1 = mac dinh, khong hau to class; set2/set3 = rect + offsets, class .set2/.set3 (nhu .theme-*).",
